   "content": "I completely understand that. I know some guys from other leagues  who I watch every day and week who have about the same amount of luck. One of them played in this league last season and experienced it here too with freezes, para’s and missing moves. This game is mainly skill based. But sometimes luck always finds it way to show and I somehow got that in that match and I can’t hide that. But that doesn’t take away how good of a battler you are. In full honesty, hand on the bible, after you missed rock slide and thunder wave, I genuinely felt bad and hoped you found a way to comeback and win that. A genuine and good battler hates to win a battle in the way I did. I always like a nice competitive and fair battle with everyone in this league. It just unfortunate that missing moves / getting hax’d is always going to find away to get in the mix. But don’t let that bring you down like that.",
